** sch_path: /foss/designs/heichip/opamp_rtr/schematic/xschem/opamp_rtr.sch
.subckt opamp_rtr vdd inp vss inn ibias out
*.PININFO inp:I out:O vdd:B inn:I ibias:I vss:B
